cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Notebash++ in your work, please cite it as below.
title: "Notebash++: Neovim with the Notepad++ keyboard"
abstract: >-
  A Neovim configuration that makes Neovim type and edit like Notepad++ 8.5.3:
  modeless editing, Windows-style selection, the full Notepad++ key table,
  its menus, Find and Replace dialog with Notepad++ regular expressions,
  column mode, macros, bookmarks, document compare and session restore.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Weiskopf
    given-names: Amos
repository-code: "https://github.com/amosWeiskopf/notebash-plus-plus"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-16"
keywords:
  - neovim
  - notepad++
  - text editor
  - keybindings
  - lua
